# Cline AI Operational Rules for Verdict Lab

## Canonical Authority Model
1. What the project is & user guide -> README.md
2. Technical design, schemas & JDay pipeline -> ARCHITECTURE.md
3. Contribution & setup instructions -> CONTRIBUTING.md
4. Security boundaries & rate limits -> SECURITY.md
5. Operational AI constraints -> .llm-context/context.md

## Critical Constraints
- Do NOT alter the server port (3000) or host binding (0.0.0.0).
- Do NOT expose `GEMINI_API_KEY` to client components.
- Do NOT disable or modify Firestore security rule ownership validations without explicit testing.
- Always run `npm run test` (Vitest) when modifying consensus scoring or regex parsers.
